        <mxCell id="-DPXh-h7QqhF4jSscgDO-134" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Hybrid PV + BESS plant (30 MWp PV, 8 MW battery)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;110 kV grid (S&quot;k max/min 2500/1500 MVA), 12 km OHL to the plant and a 50 MVA YNd11 OLTC transformer.&lt;br&gt;33 kV collector: two PV feeders with three 5 MW inverter stations each (6 MVA, 33/0.69 kV)&lt;br&gt;and a battery of 2 x 4 MW / 5 MWh. Scenario: full PV output while the battery charges at 8 MW.&lt;br&gt;Inverters are full-converter current sources (k = 1.2) in the short-circuit calculation.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Try:&lt;/b&gt; Load Flow – export at the POI, collector cable loading and voltages;&lt;br&gt;Short Circuit IEC 60909 at the POI and on the 33 kV collector; set the batteries to&lt;br&gt;discharge (negative p_mw) and rerun; Grid Code P-Q / U-Q analysis at the POI." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;fontSize=12;fillColor=#e8f5e9;strokeColor=#81c784;" vertex="1" parent="-DPXh-h7QqhF4jSscgDO-1">
